{"version":1,"content":"<p>谷歌母公司Alphabet董事長約翰・亨尼斯表示，為前英偉達CEO黃仁勳尋找繼任者難度很大，但合適的人選最終會出現。17日，亨尼斯在加州帕洛阿爾託的史丹福大學接受採訪。他稱：「我能給英偉達董事會的建議，就是再物色一位優秀的CEO。找到和黃仁勳一樣出色的人，這就是他們要做的事。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587104.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:03:51.312240+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:52:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:57:10.583950+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:57:10.583950+00:00","content_hash":"16093fc57c31eae7e4b556ba91dc1f8efa6b42aceeb88d78ebf41df5dbbf5550","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}